5. CORRECT ANSWER FORMAT
==================================================

CertifyAI uses ZERO-BASED indexes.

Therefore:

0 = Option A
1 = Option B
2 = Option C
3 = Option D

Example:

"correctAnswer": 2

means Option C is correct.

IMPORTANT:

correctAnswer MUST be an INTEGER.

Correct:
"correctAnswer": 2

Incorrect:
"correctAnswer": "C"

Incorrect:
"correctAnswer": [2]

Incorrect:
"correctAnswer": "2"

==================================================
6. EXPLANATION STYLE
==================================================

Every question must include a concise educational explanation.

Target approximately 60–120 words.

Use this structure:

Correct: [Correct option/service] — explain why it satisfies the requirement.

Why not: briefly explain why the most plausible alternatives do not fit.

Exam Tip: provide one short certification-relevant takeaway.

Keep explanations concise and useful.

Do NOT produce extremely long AI-generated explanations.

